Homework: Data Preprocessing of Machine Learning Solution Project Dataset (Submission)

  This week, you are to submit your finalized cleaned dataset. The main objective of this activity is to produce a team-approved output that will be used as a component of Milestone 1.
  
    To carry out this activity, follow the instructions:
    
    1. Review the Week 2 activity instructions.
    
    2. Collaboratively review your team output and evaluate areas for improvement to create your team-approved cleaned dataset. This is carried out by your Milestone 1 Team Leader.
    
    3. Check the output against the rubrics, discuss it with your team, and make changes as needed before submitting.
    
    4. Rename your output by adding your section, team members’ last names, and initials at the end of the title beside the Google Docs icon on the top left of the screen.
    
    
    
    Example:
    
    MO-IT125 Homework: Data Preprocessing of Machine Learning Solution Project Dataset BSIT-A1101 Dela Cruz, J., Santiago, C., Garcia, R.
    
    
    
    5. Upload your cleaned dataset to your Github repository. 
    
    6. Copy the link to your output and paste it here on Camu. This is carried out by your Milestone 1 Team Leader.
